{"version":1,"content":"<p>法國上周六（24日）多地再有大批民眾上街示威，抗議生活成本高企。</p><p>部分城市示威續演變為警民衝突。</p><p>法新社片段可見，警方在巴黎東南部街頭及the Porte de Vincennes附近施放催淚氣體，現場煙霧瀰漫。</p><p>［相關報道：法國示威再爆衝突 內政部稱41萬人遊行 全國近千人被拘］</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-25T07:58:03.546121+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T06:41:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T06:38:03.411283+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-25T07:51:13.799254+00:00","content_hash":"d31c7361b787dee462aee9ca6390569403406e46b0dcc6d9d6e7007194ac49cb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}